shape: sequence_diagram

C: {
  label: Client
}
S: {
  label: Temporal\nServer
}
W: {
  label: Workflow
}
S.style: {
  fill: "#B664FF"
  font-color: "#EEEEEE"
}

C.1 -> S.1: Signal that\ntriggers an Activity
S.1."Signal\nwritten to\nhistory"
S.1 -> C.1: Ack
C."When is the Activity done?\nHow do I get the result?"
C.2 -> S.2: Query
W -> S.2: worker poll
S.2 -> W.1: Signal that\ntriggers an Activity\n+ Query
W.1."Signal handler\n\nschedule Activity"
W.1 -> S.2: "ScheduleActivity + empty Query result"
S.2 -> C.2: empty Query result
S."dispatch Activity task\n...\nreceive Activity result"
C.3 -> S.3: Query
W -> S.3: worker poll
S.3 -> W.2: Activity result + Query
W.2."Signal handler\n\n...receive Activity result"
W.2 -> S.3: "successful Query result"
S.3 -> C.3: successful Query result
